<Slide notes={`第四个结果：尾部。允许 10% 脱靶，是两端各 5%，还是让数据自己偏。仿真里自由尾省 16% 到 22%；到真实基准只省 0 到 5%，FD004 还反向 4.3%。而且要保住数学保证，γ 必须独立于分数选，半分裂要多付 13% 宽度，31.9 涨到 36.0。所以自由尾不是免费的。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>自由尾不是免费的：仿真省 16–22%，基准只省 0–5%</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F7' }}>03 · 结果</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, height: 504, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 18, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>自由尾在仿真里省 16–22%，到基准上只剩 0–5%，FD004 还反转。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 360, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 620, height: 360, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Image src='assets/fig_tail.png' style={{ width: 620, height: 360, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 508, height: 360, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>FINDING 04</Text>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12, marginTop: 2 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 68, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>13%</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', marginBottom: 8 }}>保证成立要多付的宽度</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14, marginBottom: 12 }} />
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>仿真，已知真值</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>省 16% / 22%</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>基准四舰队</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>+5.0 / +4.2 / 0.0 / −4.3%</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568' }}>半分裂保证</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>31.9 → 36.0 周期</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 18 }}>γ 在同一批分数上选，命题的有限样本保证不成立；半分裂把 γ 与分数分开。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 48, marginTop: 16, borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 16, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>要让保证成立，γ 必须独立于它作用的分数——代价是 13% 宽度。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 20, height: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>RUL 区间测量学 · 课题组进展汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>07 / 10</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
